sequenceDiagram
    participant A1 as Admin (requester)
    participant P as Admin panel
    participant PR as Privilege service
    participant A2 as Second approver
    participant O as Action orchestrator
    participant S as Target subsystem
    participant L as Audit ledger
    A1->>P: request sensitive action (e.g. key rotation)
    P->>PR: classify action risk
    PR-->>P: requires dual-control + reason
    P->>A1: prompt for justification
    A1->>P: submit justification
    P->>A2: request approval (out-of-band notify)
    A2->>P: approve (or deny) with reason
    P->>PR: verify approver != requester, roles valid
    PR->>O: authorise (time-boxed token)
    O->>S: execute via subsystem API
    S-->>O: result
    O->>L: PQ-signed audit (who/what/why/approver)
    P-->>A1: outcome
